{\"ref\":\"num:mem_bench_aggr_ns_day\",\"name\":\"MEM throughput on a two-V100 node, two independent runs\",\"value\":300.76,\"unit\":\"ns/day\",\"basis\":\"PROXY\",\"quote\":\"2 | Gold6148F × 2 ‡ | 2 × 20 | 2.4 | V100×2 | 300.76 | 19.95 | 23 200 | and: running N simulations on nodes with N GPUs in parallel ... and reporting the aggregate performance, i.e. the sum of the performances of the individual simulations.\",\"page_setting\":\"GROMACS 2018, 81,743-atom MEM system, 2 fs, node with two Tesla V100 GPUs, aggregate of two parallel simulations\",\"differs_in\":[\"our system is a soluble peptide–receptor–glycan complex of about 80,000 atoms, not a membrane protein\",\"Lambda V100 instance CPUs differ from a dual Gold6148F node\"],\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/html/1903.05918v1\"}
